\p
\v 18 Then Yahweh¦102669 told Yehoshua, “Hold your spear out \add ≈pointing\add* towards Ay, because¦102681 I will \add ≈allow you to defeat it\add*.” \add ≈So\add* Yehoshua held the spear that¦102675 was in¦102674 his hand out toward the city¦102692.
