\v 30 Then¦102935 Yehoshua built¦102936 an¦102938 altar¦102938 to¦102939 Yisrael's¦102941 god¦102940, Yahweh¦102939 on¦102942 Mt¦102942. Eybal\x + \xo 8:30-32: \xt Deu 27:2-8.\x*
