\v 33 Then¦102991 all¦102991 of Yisrael¦102993 and their¦103015 elders¦102994 and officials¦102995 and judges¦102997 were standing¦102998 \add ≈some on each side\add* of the box containing Yahweh's agreement¦103010, \add ≈facing\add* the priests¦103005 and the Levites¦103006 who¦103007 carried¦103007 the box. Any resident foreigners were also there. Half¦103015 of the people stood on the Mt. Gerazim side, and half¦103022 on the Mt. Eybal side \add of the valley\add*, just¦103029 like \add the way that\add* Yahweh's servant¦103032 Mosheh¦103031 had¦103030 originally commanded¦103030 for blessing¦103035 the people.\x + \xo 8:33-35: \xt Deu 11:29; 27:11-14.\x*
