\v 34 Then¦103042 Yehoshua¦103046 read¦103045 all¦103048 the law, \add including\add* the blessings¦103052 and¦103053 the curses¦103053, as per everything¦103054 that's written¦103056 in¦103057 the book¦103057 of¦103057 the law.
