\v 7 An Israeli¦103190 man¦103190 asked the Hivite \add (because Gilead was in the Hivite region)\add*, “Perhaps¦103196 you really live near by? How¦103200 could we make¦103201 a treaty with¦103197 you?”\x + \xo 9:7: \xt Exo 23:32; 34:12; Deu 7:2.\x*
