\v 13 And these wineskins were new¦103310 when we¦103309 filled¦103309 them, and look, \add now\add* they're \add all\add* torn. \add ≈Same with\add* our clothes¦103314 and our sandals¦103315—they're \add all\add* worn-out from¦103317 the very¦103319 \add ≈long¦103317 journey¦103318\add*.”
