\p
\v 24 “Because¦103498 it¦103500 was¦103500 \add ≈made very clear\add* to your servants¦103501,” they answered¦103493, “that your god¦103506 Yahweh¦103505 had¦103504 commanded¦103504 his¦103510 servant¦103510 Mosheh¦103509 to give¦103511 to you all¦103515 the land¦103517 and¦103493 to destroy¦103518 everyone who lives in the region. \add ≈We¦103496 feared¦103526 for¦103528 our lives when you came closer\add*, so that's what we¦103530 did¦103530.
\v 25 \add ≈So¦103536 now¦103536 we're in¦103538 your power—do¦103544 to¦103543 us¦103543 whatever you think\add* is good¦103539 and¦103536 right¦103540.”
\v 26 \add ≈So¦103546\add* that's what \add @Yehoshua\add* did and¦103546 he \add ≈prevented the Israelis¦103554\add* from killing¦103556 them¦103556.
