\v 6 The¦103717 \add ≈leaders\add* of Gibeon¦103718 \add hurriedly\add* sent¦103716 to Yehoshua¦103721 in the camp¦103724 at Gilgal¦103725, saying¦103726, “Don't¦103727 \add ≈abandon\add* your¦103730 servants¦103731. Come¦103732 quickly¦103734 and help¦103737 us, and save¦103735 us because¦103738 all¦103741 the kings¦103743 of the Amorites¦103744 who¦103745 live in the hill¦103746 country¦103746 have¦103739 combined against¦103740 us.”
