\v 8 and¦103764 Yahweh¦103765 told \add *him¦103766\add*, “Don't¦103768 be afraid¦103771 of them, because¦103773 \add ≈you'll have¦103775 the victory over them\add*—none of them will be able to stand¦103778 against you.”
\p
\v 9 Yehoshua \add and his men\add* spent the night¦103789 moving in, and then¦103783 \add ≈surprised the alliance\add*,
\v 10 and Yahweh¦103796 confused¦103795 them \add ≈as the Israelis approached\add* and \add caused them\add* to be badly defeated¦103799 at¦103803 Gibeon¦103803. Then¦103795 \add #they\add* chased them on¦103803 the road going to Beyt-Horon¦103809 and killed them as far as Azekah¦103813 and Makkedah¦103816.
\v 11 As they fled¦103819 from the Israelis on the slope down from Beyt-Horon¦103827 heading towards Azekah¦103838, Yahweh¦103828 hurled large¦103832 hailstones down on them from the sky and¦103818 they died—\add actually\add* more of them died from the hail¦103845 than¦103846 were killed¦103847 with¦103819 swords¦103850 by the \add ≈Israelis\add*.
\p
\v 12 Then¦103853 Yehoshua spoke¦103854 to¦103856 Yahweh¦103859 on¦103871 the day¦103857 that \add ≈he gave them victory over the Amorites¦103862\add*, and¦103873 \add ≈in¦103871 front¦103863 of the Israelis¦103865\add* he said¦103866,
\q1 “Sun¦103870, stay still¦103872 over Gibeon¦103871,
\q1 ≈and moon¦103873, over the¦103862 Ayyalon Valley¦103874.
\m
\v 13 Then¦103877 the sun stood still and the moon¦103879 stood still until¦103881 the nation¦103884 had avenged¦103883 themselves of their enemies¦103885. (Isn't that written¦103889 about¦103902 in the Jashar scroll¦103892? The¦103893 sun stood still in the middle¦103896 of the sky and it¦103900 didn't¦103886 hurry to¦103901 go¦103901 around for almost a whole day¦103902.\x + \xo 10:13: \xt 2Sam 1:18.\x*
\v 14 There¦103916 had¦103906 never before¦103909 been¦103906 a day¦103907 like that¦103908, and¦103905 nothing like it since¦103910 then¦103905, when Yahweh¦103912 listened¦103911 to a man's¦103914 voice¦103913, because¦103915 \add *he¦103916\add* was¦103917 fighting¦103917 for¦103918 Yisrael¦103918.)
\p
\v 15 Then Yehoshua and all¦103923 Yisrael¦103925 returned¦103921 to their camp¦103929 at Gilgal¦103930.
