\v 19 but¦103964 \add the rest of you,\add* don't¦103965 stay there. Chase after¦103969 your enemies¦103970 and¦103964 attack¦103971 them from behind. Don't¦103965 let them get into their¦103979 cities¦103979, because¦103980 your god¦103983 Yahweh¦103982 \add ≈wants you all to defeat them\add*.
