\v 25 Then¦104125 he¦104138 told them¦104126, “Don't¦104128 be afraid¦104130 and don't¦104128 be dismayed¦104133. Be¦104127 strong¦104134 and courageous¦104135, because¦104136 this is what Yahweh¦104139 will¦104138 do¦104138 to all your¦104142 enemies¦104142—\add ≈including¦104131 the ones that you¦104144 all still have\add* to fight¦104145.”
\v 26 Then¦104148 Yehoshua¦104149 executed \add @the five kings\add* and¦104148 hanged¦104159 them on¦104155 five trees¦104157, \add ≈where their bodies were¦104158 left\add* until¦104163 evening¦104165.
\v 27 As¦104173 the sun¦104171 was¦104170 going¦104170 down, \add *he\add* commanded¦104172 that¦104196 \add @the bodies\add* be brought down and thrown¦104177 into¦104178 the cave where¦104181 they had¦104182 hidden¦104182, and they placed¦104185 large¦104187 rocks¦104186 over¦104188 the cave entrance \add again, which are still there\add* to this¦104196 day¦104195.
