\s4 Promised land
\p
\v 1 Now the years¦105394 had passed and Yehoshua had grown old, and Yahweh¦105389 said¦105388 to him¦105390, “You're old \add now\add* and \add ≈there's still a lot of land that needs to be captured\add*.
\v 2 This is the remaining¦105404 land¦105403: all the territories¦105407 of the Philistines¦105408, and¦105409 all of the Geshurites¦105411,
\v 3 from Shihor¦105415 (\add ≈east\add* of Egypt¦105421) and as far as the border¦105423 of Ekron to the north¦105425 (it's considered to be Canaanite¦105426), the five¦105428 rulers¦105430 of the Philistines¦105431 (in Gaza¦105432, Ashdod¦105433, Ashkelon¦105434, Gat¦105435, and Ekron), and the Avvites¦105437.
\v 4 In the south¦105439: all¦105440 the land¦105442 of the Canaanites¦105443, and¦105444 a Mearah that¦105445 \add belongs to\add* the Sidonians¦105446, as far as Afek¦105449, as far as the border¦105451 of the Amorites¦105452,
\v 5 plus¦105456 the land of¦105455 the Gebalites¦105455, all¦105456 Lebanon¦105458 towards the east, from¦105461 Baal¦105461-Gad¦105462 below Mt¦105464. Hermon¦105466 as far as Lebo¦105468-Hamath¦105469.
\v 6 I myself will \add ≈drive¦105486 out\add* all those who live in¦105493 the hill¦105474 country¦105474 from¦105475 Lebanon¦105477 as far as Misrefot¦105480-Maim, and all the Sidonians¦105484. \add ≈Make¦105491 sure that it's¦105491 given\add* to¦105492 \add ≈the Israelis¦105489\add* as an¦105493 inheritance¦105493, just¦105494 as I instructed¦105495 you.\x + \xo 13:6: \xt Num 33:54.\x*
\v 7 All¦105499 that¦105502 land¦105501 should be divided up as an¦105503 inheritance¦105503 for the nine¦105504 tribes¦105505 plus¦105506 \add half of\add* the half-tribe of Menashsheh¦105508.
