\v 30 It¦105857 went from¦105859 Mahanaim¦105859, all the Bashan, all the kingdom¦105865 of Og¦105867 (the king¦105868 of the Bashan), and¦105871 all the towns of Yair¦105874, which¦105875 are¦105876 in¦105876 the Bashan—sixty¦105877 cities.
