\v 9 These are the names of the cities¦109012 \add ≈allocated by the Israeli leaders (from the regions occupied by\add* Yehudah¦109007 and Shimeon)
\v 10 that were given to¦109021 the Levite Kohat clans¦109023 since \add ≈they were selected first¦109031 in the draw\add*:
